{"id":"5845ef9114a1d1d9","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-many-one-reducibility.md","title":"Many-one Reducibility","display":"df-many-one-reducibility — Many-one Reducibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-many-one-reducibility","aliases":["68-df-many-one-reducibility"],"display":"df-many-one-reducibility — Many-one Reducibility","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-df-natural-number]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§13 definition before 13.3, p.44 / PDF 53","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-many-one-reducibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-many-one-reducibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-one-reducibility — Many-one Reducibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3368c1852f2a1aa0\" href=\"?note=3368c1852f2a1aa0\" title=\"68-df-natural-number\">68-df-natural-number</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§13 definition before 13.3, p.44 / PDF 53"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_m\">\\(\\equiv_m\\)</span> 为下式定义的一元集合关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leq_m B\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leq_m B\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_m B\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\leq_m B\\land B\\leq_m A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_m B\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\leq_m B\\land B\\leq_m A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 §13，印刷 p.44 / PDF p.53，关系间 many-one reduction 的一元集合特例。显式要求 f:N→N，避免 TotalRec 中的零元或多元函数误入见证域。原书一般版本允许目标关系有多个输入，并给每个坐标一个全递归替换函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"3368c1852f2a1aa0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-natural-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]。$\\leq_m$ 与 $\\equiv_m$ 为下式定义的一元集合关系。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_m","display":false},{"tex":"A\\leq_m B\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\equiv_m B\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\leq_m B\\land B\\leq_m A.","display":true}],"bytes":1269,"backlinks":[{"id":"5afd25b07b64f3c2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-many-one-reducibility]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-many-one-reducibility]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-many-one-reducibility|df-many-one-reducibility — Many-one Reducibility]]"}],"outgoing":["a82d826d433dcff3","3368c1852f2a1aa0"]}